Verse 1
[Am]On [Em]my [F]heart [Am]im[C]print Thine [E]image, Bles[Am]sed [Dm]Je[Am]sus, King [E]of [Am]Grace
That [Em]life's [F]ri[Am]ches, [C]cares, and [E]pleasures, Have [Am]no [Dm]pow'r [Am]to Thee [E]ef[Am]face;
[C]This [G]the [C]super[F]scription be: [C]Je[G]sus [F]cru[C]cified [G]for [C]me,
Is [Am]my life, [Em]my [F]hope's foun[E]dation, And [Am]my [Dm]glo[Am]ry [E]and [Am]salvation.
